{{!-- The checklist a growth is being earned through. What it did to a maximum is printed on
      the Description tab, under WHAT WAS GAINED, beside the words the Warden writes there.

      MILESTONES are the Warden's checklist (`srd-2e/wardens-guide/growth.md` — Faction
      Advancement, and the resolution of a Bond). They are typed, and the inputs are indexed
      (`system.milestones.0.text`, `.1.text`, …) because `DocumentSheetV2#_processFormData` runs
      `foundry.utils.expandObject` over the form and `ArrayField._cast` turns the resulting
      integer-keyed object back into an array — so a plain form submit reaches the model with no
      help. The tick is the system's toggle primitive, whose checkbox stays in the form and is
      only taken out of the visual order, so an unticked one still submits `false`. The indices have to stay contiguous or the array comes back with holes, which is why
      removing a row rewrites the whole array rather than blanking one input.

      Nothing here gates the outcome on the list being complete. The SRD states no such rule, and
      inventing one would put the Warden's judgement inside the software. --}}
<section class="tab {{tabs.details.cssClass}}" data-group="primary" data-tab="details">
    <div class="cairn-zone-head">
        <h4 class="cairn-zone">{{localize 'CAIRN.Growth.Milestones'}}</h4>
        <a class="cairn-zone-add" data-action="milestoneAdd">
            <i class="fas fa-plus" inert></i><span>{{localize 'CAIRN.Growth.AddMilestone'}}</span>
        </a>
    </div>
    <div class="cairn-zone-rule" data-ink="hline" data-ink-seed="zone-growth-milestones" data-ink-w="1" data-ink-a="0.34"></div>
    <ol class="cairn-plain-list">
        {{#each system.milestones as |m i|}}
        <li class="cairn-slot" data-index="{{i}}"
            {{#unless @last}}data-ink="hline" data-ink-seed="growth-ms-{{i}}" data-ink-w="0.9" data-ink-a="0.42" data-ink-at="bottom"{{/unless}}>
            <span class="cairn-slot-body">
                {{> "systems/cairn2e/templates/parts/toggle.hbs" field=(concat "system.milestones." i ".done") value=m.done}}
                <input class="cairn-row-input" type="text" name="system.milestones.{{i}}.text" value="{{m.text}}"
                    placeholder="{{localize 'CAIRN.Growth.MilestonePlaceholder'}}" />
            </span>
            <span class="cairn-item-controls">
                <a data-action="milestoneRemove" data-tooltip="{{localize 'CAIRN.Remove'}}"><i class="fas fa-xmark"></i></a>
            </span>
        </li>
        {{else}}
        <li class="cairn-empty">{{localize 'CAIRN.Growth.NoMilestones'}}</li>
        {{/each}}
    </ol>
</section>
